  "id": "20_Leaders_Who_Built_the_CISO_Era_2_Decades_of_Change_txt_70",
  "content": "The director role would remain empty, and CISA leaderless, until Joe Biden took office and appointed Jen Easterly as the next leader of the agency. Krebs meanwhile went on to private-sector roles on advisory boards, consulting gigs, Black Hat keynotes , teaching stints, a talking head spot at CBS News, and the role of Chief Intelligence and Public Policy Officer at SentinelOne. But Trump's memory is long; after taking office the second time, the president revoked Krebs’s security clearance , posted a permanent page on the White House website declaring Krebs a \"significant bad-faith actor,\" and ultimately, Krebs resigned from SentinelOne so he could focus on his legal defense.",
